    CTRL["EC2 · CloudFormation · Image Builder<br/>SSM · IAM · STS"]:::aws
  end

  CLI -->|compile dep| MODEL
  RUN -->|compile dep| MODEL
  CLI -. "renders script text" .-> SH
  SH -. "argv as strings (B4)" .-> RUN

  CLI --> CTRL
